# Open Yahtzee README

## Compiling from source
To compile source from a distributed tarball, simply execute

    :::console
    $ ./configure
    $ make
    # make install

If you are trying to compile the source directly from git, start by
executing

    :::console
    $ autoreconf --install

and then proceed just like in the tarball case.

